# Prisma (server-side only) — use the "Session pooler" connection string
# from Supabase (port 5432, host aws-0-*.pooler.supabase.com). Direct
# connection (db.*.supabase.co) is IPv6-only and often unreachable from
# IPv4-only home networks.
DATABASE_URL=
